			titleEn: isThunder ? `⚡ Broadband & Wi-Fi Alert: Thunderstorm expected in ${weather.cityEn}!` : `🌧️ Broadband & Wi-Fi Alert: Severe storm & rain expected in ${weather.cityEn}!`,
